{"schema_version":"1.9.2","id":"ALSA-2026:99053","published":"2026-11-11T00:00:00Z","modified":"2026-11-13T12:15:02.336780895Z","related":["CVE-2026-105544","CVE-2026-109475","CVE-2026-109476","CVE-2026-114146","CVE-2026-114147","CVE-2026-114149"],"upstream":["CVE-2026-105544","CVE-2026-109475","CVE-2026-109476","CVE-2026-114146","CVE-2026-114147","CVE-2026-114149"],"summary":"Important: .NET 10.0 security, bug fix, and enhancement update","details":".NET is a fast, lightweight and modular platform for creating cross platform applications that work on Linux, macOS and Windows. It particularly focuses on creating console applications, web applications and micro-services. .NET contains a runtime conforming to .NET Standards a set of framework libraries, an SDK containing compilers and a 'dotnet' application to drive everything.  \n\nSDK version: 10.0.115  \nRuntime version: 10.0.15  \n\nSecurity Fix(es):  \n\n  * dotnet8.0: dotnet11.0: dotnet9.0: dotnet10.0: ASP.NET Core Information Disclosure Vulnerability (CVE-2026-109476)\n  * dotnet11.0: dotnet10.0: dotnet9.0: dotnet8.0: .NET Elevation of Privilege Vulnerability (CVE-2026-105544)\n  * dotnet8.0: dotnet9.0: dotnet11.0: dotnet10.0: .NET Denial of Service Vulnerability (CVE-2026-109475)\n  * dotnet9.0: dotnet11.0: dotnet10.0: dotnet8.0: dotnet: ASP.NET Core Elevation of Privilege Vulnerability (CVE-2026-114146)\n  * dotnet11.0: dotnet8.0: dotnet9.0: dotnet10.0: ASP.NET Core Denial of Service Vulnerability (CVE-2026-114147)\n  * dotnet11.0: dotnet8.0: dotnet9.0: dotnet10.0: ASP.NET Core Denial of Service Vulnerability (CVE-2026-114149)\n\n\nBug Fix(es) and Enhancement(s):  \n\n  * Update .NET 10.0 to SDK 10.0.115 and Runtime 10.0.15 (JIRA:RHEL-302519)\n\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.\n","affected":[{"package":{"name":"aspnetcore-runtime-10.0","ecosystem":"Alma